14
00:00:45,574 --> 00:00:50,624
Swimming together? As someone who despises men,
 are you really going to allow that?

15
00:00:52,954 --> 00:00:54,214
Celis?

16
00:00:55,544 --> 00:00:57,004
Saniya.

17
00:00:57,004 --> 00:00:59,174
I told Luno, so I should tell you too.

18
00:00:59,174 --> 00:01:02,714
I don't actually despise men.

19
00:01:04,424 --> 00:01:08,474
Truth be told, I look up to
 and am fascinated by them.

20
00:01:08,474 --> 00:01:14,354
When I was very young, I had a teacher
 who was a strong and kind man.

21
00:01:14,354 --> 00:01:21,114
But I... I don't know how to interact with young men.

22
00:01:22,864 --> 00:01:24,114
Moreover...

23
00:01:25,154 --> 00:01:29,374
In my position, I can't afford to rely on men.

24
00:01:30,074 --> 00:01:33,624
Because I'm the eldest daughter of House Ralgris, one of the Four Great Houses,

25
