106
00:03:17,644 --> 00:03:19,934
Hey! Luxy!

107
00:03:20,984 --> 00:03:21,944
Over here!

108
00:03:22,354 --> 00:03:25,234
Come on. Everyone's waiting for you.

109
00:03:26,484 --> 00:03:31,154
M-My bad. I didn't see anything.

110
00:03:31,154 --> 00:03:34,204
No. I think you're misunderstanding something.

111
00:03:34,204 --> 00:03:35,124
Huh?

112
00:03:36,624 --> 00:03:39,124
The clothes we're wearing are not underwear.

113
00:03:39,584 --> 00:03:42,464
Apparently these are called swimsuits.

114
00:03:42,464 --> 00:03:44,754
It's the first time I've worn one though.

115
00:03:48,714 --> 00:03:51,384
Was that cold, Lu?

116
00:03:51,384 --> 00:03:52,764
Phi?

117
00:03:53,134 --> 00:03:54,934
Yeah, it was.

118
00:03:56,304 --> 00:03:58,354
I told you, it's cold!

119
00:03:58,354 --> 00:04:00,604
Philuffy's in high spirits.

120
00:03:59,854 --> 00:04:03,484
Stop it already! Hey, come on! It's cold!

121
00:04:00,604 --> 00:04:02,024
That's unusual.

122
00:04:02,024 --> 00:04:02,814
Yes.

123
00:04:03,484 --> 00:04:05,064
I'm out of here!

124
00:04:04,564 --> 00:04:06,274
Oh, he ran away.

125
00:04:10,654 --> 00:04:12,824
What's wrong, Lisha?

126
00:04:14,574 --> 00:04:19,664
Well, this shows more of my belly than I expected.

127
00:04:21,164 --> 00:04:22,794
It's fine.

128
00:04:22,794 --> 00:04:25,964
And you look great in that swimsuit.

129
00:04:25,964 --> 00:04:28,634
Wh-What are you talking about, you perv?!

130
00:04:28,634 --> 00:04:29,674
What?

131
00:04:29,674 --> 00:04:31,924
Oh, my. How nice.

132
00:04:31,924 --> 00:04:35,384
Boys and girls enjoying their youth.

133
00:04:35,384 --> 00:04:39,934
We came all the way out to this island,
 so we should let loose a bit.

134
00:04:39,934 --> 00:04:41,524
Miss Relie too?

135
00:04:41,524 --> 00:04:44,734
Oh, you shouldn't discriminate, Lux.

136
00:04:44,734 --> 00:04:46,774
I'm a girl too, you know.

137
00:04:46,774 --> 00:04:48,524
Yeah, a "girl"...

138
00:04:50,784 --> 00:04:51,444
Airi?

139
00:04:52,034 --> 00:04:53,864
You're the worst, Lux!

140
00:04:53,864 --> 00:04:55,864
What? I didn't say anything!

141
00:04:55,864 --> 00:04:58,204
Even your own sister! You deviant!

142
00:04:58,204 --> 00:04:59,164
What?!

143
00:05:00,284 --> 00:05:02,414
I mean no disrespect, Headmistress,

144
00:05:03,874 --> 00:05:07,884
but we came to this island to train.

145
00:05:09,544 --> 00:05:15,594
You say that, but you still came,
 and in a pretty cute swimsuit too.

146
00:05:15,594 --> 00:05:21,014
Th-This is what Lunoâ€”I mean,
 a younger student chose for me,

147
00:05:21,014 --> 00:05:23,064
because we heard there'd be swimming training.

148
00:05:23,984 --> 00:05:26,314
Speaking of which, where is Luno?

149
00:05:27,734 --> 00:05:30,524
Luno? Did we have a girl by that name?

150
00:05:33,734 --> 00:05:37,574
Lux, we have a small present for you.

151
00:05:37,994 --> 00:05:38,704
Huh?

152
00:05:39,574 --> 00:05:40,784
What?!

153
00:05:40,784 --> 00:05:43,084
There's no need for me to be bait now!

154
00:05:43,624 --> 00:05:47,164
I don't think the suspicious man
 from school could possibly be here.

155
00:05:47,164 --> 00:05:48,964
We can't be sure of that.

156
00:05:48,964 --> 00:05:50,334
Yeah.

157
00:05:50,334 --> 00:05:53,554
Yes. The investigation is going well.

158
00:05:53,554 --> 00:05:54,344
Huh?

159
00:05:54,344 --> 00:05:55,464
What are youâ€”

160
00:05:55,844 --> 00:05:57,134
Come on, now!

161
00:05:57,134 --> 00:05:57,724
This again?

162
00:05:57,724 --> 00:06:02,564
When else would we get the chance to see Luxy in a sexy swimsuit?

163
00:06:02,564 --> 00:06:04,684
Yes. You have to supply the demand.

164
00:06:04,684 --> 00:06:05,734
What are you talking about?!

165
00:06:05,734 --> 00:06:07,234
Resign yourself to your fate!

166
00:06:07,234 --> 00:06:09,024
Whaâ€”Stop! Stop!

167
00:06:11,524 --> 00:06:12,984
Celis!

168
00:06:16,784 --> 00:06:17,574
I'm sorry.

169
00:06:17,574 --> 00:06:18,534
Oops.

170
00:06:18,534 --> 00:06:22,994
You'll soon face me in battle,
 yet you think you have time to fool around?

171
00:06:23,454 --> 00:06:24,334
No, that's not whatâ€”

172
00:06:24,334 --> 00:06:25,294
Oh, my.

173
00:06:25,294 --> 00:06:26,374
Lux...

174
00:06:26,374 --> 00:06:28,754
Let's go, Celis.

175
00:06:29,294 --> 00:06:33,754
Headmistress, if there's no swimming practice, we'll be heading back to the lodging house.

176
00:06:37,844 --> 00:06:42,014
<i>I have to apologize to Lux Arcadia.</i>

177
00:06:43,394 --> 00:06:45,604
What do you mean?

178
00:06:45,604 --> 00:06:51,234
I learned fencing and tactics from Mr. Wade Roadbelt.

179
00:06:51,234 --> 00:06:52,024
Huh?

180
00:06:52,944 --> 00:06:55,734
He was Lux Arcadia's grandfather.

181
00:06:56,114 --> 00:07:00,954
It would be no exaggeration to say 
that I owe all my skill to him.

182
00:07:00,954 --> 00:07:06,994
But in the end, Mr. Wade died because of me.

183
00:07:07,454 --> 00:07:11,874
That's why I want to protect his grandson from danger.

184
00:07:12,714 --> 00:07:17,764
That's also one of the reasons why I must win the upcoming duel.

185
00:07:26,314 --> 00:07:29,524
<i>But I can't afford to lose either.</i>

186
00:07:47,994 --> 00:07:50,414
We'll have you two spar.

187
00:07:51,084 --> 00:07:55,424
As a special provision,
 the winner's request shall be granted.

188
00:07:56,214 --> 00:08:02,804
Lux Arcadia's request is to remain in our school
 and take part in the subjugation of the Ragnarok.

189
00:08:03,384 --> 00:08:09,684
Celistia's request is for Lux Arcadia to leave the school
 and be prohibited from taking part in the subjugation.

190
00:08:10,104 --> 00:08:11,684
Are your requests as stated?

191
00:08:11,984 --> 00:08:13,064
Yes.

192
00:08:13,064 --> 00:08:17,194
Well, then, draw your swords and
 equip your Machine Dragons.

193
00:08:19,904 --> 00:08:23,864
Descend, O royal dragon who inherits the blood of rulers.

194
00:08:23,864 --> 00:08:28,834
Gambol in the heavens dressed in numberless lightings, Lindwurm!

195
00:08:32,914 --> 00:08:37,214
So that's the Divine Raiment Machine Dragon of the girl said to be the school's strongest.

196
00:08:37,594 --> 00:08:38,464
Yes.

197
00:08:38,464 --> 00:08:42,974
But why is Lux using a Wyvern instead of Bahamut?

198
00:08:42,974 --> 00:08:49,474
Among the girls of the squadron here, some still don't know about Bahamut.

199
00:08:50,184 --> 00:08:52,934
He would like to keep it hidden as far as he can.

200
00:08:52,934 --> 00:08:54,194
Also...

201
00:08:54,194 --> 00:08:55,234
Also?

202
00:08:55,644 --> 00:08:59,364
I think he still has a chance to win.

203
00:09:06,574 --> 00:09:12,204
Where are you going in such a hurry,
 Ms. Heiburg Republic Spy?

204
00:09:14,254 --> 00:09:16,714
We have proof.

205
00:09:16,714 --> 00:09:21,844
These are your secret messages for our neighbors of 
the Heiburg Republic, detailing events at our school.

206
00:09:22,964 --> 00:09:26,344
And the suspicious person showing up at school...

207
00:09:27,134 --> 00:09:28,764
That was also your doing, wasn't it?

208
00:09:29,264 --> 00:09:33,314
Apparently you set it up in order to frame Luxy.

209
00:09:33,934 --> 00:09:35,814
We know everything.

210
00:09:35,814 --> 00:09:40,314
Why not take off that mask and confess,

211
00:09:40,314 --> 00:09:41,734
Saniya?

212
00:09:42,984 --> 00:09:45,114
Looks like I don't have to
 put up this front anymore.

213
00:09:53,164 --> 00:09:54,954
Why are you doing this?

214
00:09:54,954 --> 00:10:01,794
My mission is to kill you all, 
undermining the new kingdom's military force!

215
00:10:06,724 --> 00:10:08,224
This sound...

216
00:10:27,154 --> 00:10:28,534
What is that?!

217
00:10:28,534 --> 00:10:30,364
Is that really a Machine Dragon?!

218
00:10:30,364 --> 00:10:36,874
It's time to put an end to these
 boring spars and have a real battle,

219
00:10:36,874 --> 00:10:39,004
you sheltered aristocrats!

220
00:10:43,134 --> 00:10:43,884
Prepare yourself!

221
00:10:52,604 --> 00:10:55,974
Your Machine Dragon is starting to go out of control. Surrender!

222
00:10:57,434 --> 00:10:59,024
Recoil Burst!

223
00:11:00,524 --> 00:11:01,404
Divine Gate!

224
00:11:04,774 --> 00:11:05,694
What?!

225
00:11:06,534 --> 00:11:07,534
Teleportation?

226
00:11:08,194 --> 00:11:09,864
Starlight Zero!

227
00:11:10,534 --> 00:11:11,284
What?!

228
00:11:22,044 --> 00:11:23,174
Celis!

229
00:11:23,924 --> 00:11:25,214
This is a state of emergency!

230
00:11:25,214 --> 00:11:26,964
Start evacuating the island's civilians!

231
00:11:26,964 --> 00:11:27,844
Yes, ma'am!

232
00:11:31,634 --> 00:11:33,184
Philuffy?

233
00:11:49,904 --> 00:11:51,704
Relie...

234
00:11:52,824 --> 00:11:58,124
Don't worry. I won't let anyone take you.

235
00:11:58,954 --> 00:12:02,004
Even if I have to stand against the new kingdom.

236
00:12:10,304 --> 00:12:11,514
Are you all right?

237
00:12:12,474 --> 00:12:14,724
This wound is nothing.

238
00:12:17,854 --> 00:12:19,264
Could that be...

239
00:12:19,264 --> 00:12:23,484
Yes. It's probably the Ragnarok that was supposed to be reviving soon.

240
00:12:24,604 --> 00:12:25,984
Celis!

241
00:12:25,984 --> 00:12:28,074
I'll take it down by myself.

242
00:12:28,074 --> 00:12:31,364
It's my fault for allowing the enemy to come this close.

243
00:12:31,364 --> 00:12:32,614
This is my responsibility!

244
00:12:32,614 --> 00:12:34,744
No! Don't be reckless!

245
00:12:38,494 --> 00:12:39,494
Divine Gate!

246
00:12:47,424 --> 00:12:48,384
This is the end of you!

247
00:12:54,974 --> 00:12:56,224
Celis!

248
00:12:58,764 --> 00:13:00,394
I'd expect nothing less from my Celis.

249
00:13:02,434 --> 00:13:04,694
You're still alive.

250
00:13:06,024 --> 00:13:07,604
Saniya?!

251
00:13:07,604 --> 00:13:12,034
But you can't possibly think it'll end like this.

252
00:13:12,034 --> 00:13:15,074
Saniya! What are you doing?

253
00:13:18,664 --> 00:13:21,244
Is that... Fugil?

254
00:13:29,714 --> 00:13:30,884
It came back to life!

255
00:13:30,884 --> 00:13:33,054
How can that be?!

256
00:13:33,514 --> 00:13:39,514
It is regrettable, but you have to die, Celis!

257
00:13:42,104 --> 00:13:44,184
Lux Arcadia!

258
00:13:44,184 --> 00:13:45,984
You again?

259
00:13:45,984 --> 00:13:48,944
You're a fool, handyman prince!

260
00:13:48,944 --> 00:13:50,984
I bet you don't even know anything.

261
00:13:51,944 --> 00:13:53,364
Saniya! Don't!

262
00:13:53,364 --> 00:13:56,244
The person responsible for
 your grandfather's demise...

263
00:13:56,244 --> 00:13:58,074
is the girl behind you!

264
00:14:13,964 --> 00:14:17,224
Hey! Celis! Celis!

265
00:14:17,224 --> 00:14:19,894
Stay strong, Celis!

266
00:14:22,764 --> 00:14:23,854
I'm sorry.

267
00:14:23,854 --> 00:14:24,814
Huh?

268
00:14:25,314 --> 00:14:28,564
I couldn't bring myself to tell you.

269
00:14:28,564 --> 00:14:32,824
About Mr. Wade, your grandfather.

270
00:14:33,524 --> 00:14:39,454
When I was very young, by chance I overheard details
 of the depravities in the empire's governance.

271
00:14:39,454 --> 00:14:42,574
I told Mr. Wade what I'd heard and he officially reported it.

272
00:14:42,574 --> 00:14:47,044
He was thrown in jail and died there.

273
00:14:47,044 --> 00:14:54,594
And top it all off, all of his lineage
 were banished from the imperial court.

274
00:14:56,004 --> 00:15:01,724
But the last thing Mr. Wade told me
 was that I did the right thing.

275
00:15:02,594 --> 00:15:07,144
So I must fight for justice in his stead.

276
00:15:07,144 --> 00:15:11,604
What I wanted was to
 distance you from danger.

277
00:15:12,404 --> 00:15:15,074
But I failed.

278
00:15:15,074 --> 00:15:18,494
I was deceived and got you involved in this fight.

279
00:15:19,244 --> 00:15:20,744
I'm sorry.

280
00:15:20,744 --> 00:15:22,244
You must hate me.

281
00:15:22,954 --> 00:15:26,994
No. I don't.

282
00:15:29,964 --> 00:15:32,334
That black sword device!

283
00:15:32,334 --> 00:15:35,004
That's the one Luno was carrying.

284
00:15:35,384 --> 00:15:37,174
I'm sorry I didn't tell you.

285
00:15:37,174 --> 00:15:39,554
You can scold me about it later.

286
00:15:41,634 --> 00:15:45,514
Manifest, O violent dragon who
 feasts on the flesh and blood of gods!

287
00:15:46,564 --> 00:15:48,644
Sever the black clouds of heaven,

288
00:15:52,024 --> 00:15:53,314
Bahamut!

289
00:15:58,904 --> 00:16:02,204
A jet-black Divine Raiment Machine Dragon?

290
00:16:02,954 --> 00:16:05,664
I don't hate you, Celis.

291
00:16:06,834 --> 00:16:12,164
You're strong and kind.
 A little awkward, but I like you.

292
00:16:13,544 --> 00:16:15,504
So I'll protect you.

293
00:16:16,214 --> 00:16:19,674
In place of my grandfather whom you hold in such high esteem.

294
00:16:22,844 --> 00:16:24,554
So you came, Black Hero.

295
00:16:24,554 --> 00:16:25,554
You too are going toâ€”

296
00:16:25,554 --> 00:16:26,684
Out of my way!

297
00:16:29,724 --> 00:16:31,604
It makes no difference. It's already over.

298
00:16:31,604 --> 00:16:35,194
You can't kill a regenerating Ragnarok by yourself!

299
00:16:35,564 --> 00:16:36,944
Reload on Fire.

300
00:16:52,834 --> 00:16:54,214
End Action.

301
00:16:54,624 --> 00:16:57,294
It's one of my brother's special techniques.

302
00:16:57,294 --> 00:17:01,964
He continuously sends commands into the Machine 
Dragon before it finishes executing his previous one,

303
00:17:01,964 --> 00:17:05,434
enabling him to execute an unlimited amount of consecutive attacks.

304
00:17:05,434 --> 00:17:07,304
Unlimited?

305
00:17:07,304 --> 00:17:08,804
It does end eventually.

306
00:17:08,804 --> 00:17:12,774
But not when his attack is parried.

307
00:17:13,644 --> 00:17:18,064
It's when Lux has seen
 everything through to the end.

308
00:17:18,444 --> 00:17:21,074
Give it up! You'll exhaust your 
strength long before youâ€”

309
00:17:21,694 --> 00:17:23,244
The Ragnarok will exhaust <i>its</i> strength.

310
00:17:24,404 --> 00:17:26,824
Surrender, Saniya.

311
00:17:26,824 --> 00:17:28,824
Before this fight is over.

312
00:17:29,834 --> 00:17:31,914
You actually think you can win me over?

313
00:17:31,914 --> 00:17:37,374
You, the rich girl honor student who couldn't see
 who I was and who can't tell right from wrong?!

314
00:17:39,844 --> 00:17:43,304
Can you really stab me?

315
00:17:47,514 --> 00:17:50,354
Farewell, Celis.

316
00:18:09,704 --> 00:18:14,124
Well, I never expected you to kill that Ragnarok.

317
00:18:17,004 --> 00:18:17,544
That's...

318
00:18:23,174 --> 00:18:26,634
But maybe it would've been better
 if you hadn't killed it.

319
00:18:26,634 --> 00:18:33,184
Now you've really pissed me off, Black Hero.

320
00:18:33,184 --> 00:18:35,144
Who are you?!

321
00:18:43,484 --> 00:18:45,154
You're not Fugil!

322
00:18:45,904 --> 00:18:47,744
Don't put me in the same
 category as that guy.

323
00:18:47,744 --> 00:18:49,654
Do you know him?

324
00:18:51,034 --> 00:18:52,664
My name is Hayes.

325
00:18:52,664 --> 00:18:55,664
I'm looking forward to this, fake prince.

326
00:18:55,664 --> 00:18:58,914
The nightmare from five years ago 
will soon return!

327
00:18:59,464 --> 00:19:01,464
The nightmare from five years ago?

328
00:19:01,884 --> 00:19:06,514
Have you forgotten what happened on this island back then?

329
00:19:27,154 --> 00:19:28,744
There. You're as good as new.

330
00:19:30,114 --> 00:19:31,534
This isn't okay.

331
00:19:31,534 --> 00:19:32,494
Huh?

332
00:19:32,494 --> 00:19:37,374
I thank you for forgiving me,
 but I object to the Luno matter.

333
00:19:37,374 --> 00:19:39,254
I'm really sorry.

334
00:19:39,704 --> 00:19:44,884
You saw so many embarrassing sides of me.

335
00:19:44,884 --> 00:19:49,014
It's unacceptable! Unfair! Cruel! Frustrating!

336
00:19:49,014 --> 00:19:54,514
Um... Is there anything I can do
 to make you feel better?

337
00:19:54,514 --> 00:19:59,524
But what bothers me the most is that I was happy when you saved me.

338
00:19:59,524 --> 00:20:00,024
Huh?

339
00:20:01,184 --> 00:20:05,404
I've always strived to never need anyone's help.

340
00:20:07,194 --> 00:20:12,244
I don't understand how men feel
 or how to talk with them.

341
00:20:12,244 --> 00:20:18,794
So teach me. Like your
 grandfather once taught me.

342
00:20:19,584 --> 00:20:21,044
That's what I'll ask of you.

343
00:20:21,544 --> 00:20:22,964
You mean...

344
00:20:22,964 --> 00:20:25,424
Yes. In the name of House Ralgris,

345
00:20:25,424 --> 00:20:33,184
I hereby accept your enrollment in the academy and
 your entry into the knight squadron, Lux Arcadia.

346
00:20:34,264 --> 00:20:35,804
Thank you.

347
00:20:37,304 --> 00:20:40,894
But you know, if you show them
 how kind you actually are,

348
00:20:40,894 --> 00:20:44,394
I'm sure everyone will find you sweet and come to love you!

349
00:20:45,444 --> 00:20:46,814
Sweet?

350
00:20:48,064 --> 00:20:52,194
That was the first time
 a man has called me that.

351
00:21:01,504 --> 00:21:03,504
The nightmare from five years ago...

352
00:21:17,554 --> 00:21:20,144
It's no good. I can't remember.

353
00:21:30,114 --> 00:21:31,364
What's happening?!

354
00:21:31,364 --> 00:21:33,784
This is sooner than expected.

